; The in-process generated-code routes as engines for the comparison
; coordinator: the body's Loop IR bundle emitted as C and built with the host
; compiler, or as WebAssembly and run under node, with the Loop emitter or the
; structured SSA backend making the kernels. Registered with the variant
; vocabulary by [register]; a missing compiler or node is a refusal naming it.

